# TrainTrack title system

Typography is determined by **semantic hierarchy**, not by page. Do not invent one-off heading styles.

Aim for ~**10% editorial (Barlow Condensed)** / ~**90% functional UI (Manrope)**.

CSS classes live in `src/app/globals.css`. React helpers in `src/components/ui/typography.tsx`. Tokens in `src/lib/design-tokens.ts` (`typography.*`).

**Live reference:** `/style-guide`

## Levels

| Level | Class | Font | Use |
|---|---|---|---|
| **1 Display** | `title-display` | Barlow italic uppercase ~20–26px · single color | Editorial page H1 only — `PLAN THE SEASON.`, Home greeting |
| **1 Page** | `title-page` / `PageTitle` | Manrope ~20–26px | Functional page H1 — Training, Results, Stats, Tools |
| **2 Section** | `title-section` / `SectionTitle` | Manrope 16px · not italic · uppercase | Content sections — `UPCOMING`, `TODAY'S WORKOUT`, `THIS WEEK`, Settings |
| **3 Eyebrow** | `title-eyebrow` / `EyebrowTitle` | Manrope 10px / 0.10em / uppercase | Metadata — `NEXT RACE`, `MONTHLY VOLUME` |
| **4 Card** | `title-card` / `CardTitle` | Manrope 15px sentence case | Workout/race names — `Easy Ride` |
| **Day** | `title-day` / `DayLabel` | Manrope 10px uppercase | `WEDNESDAY 12 AUG` |

Barlow Condensed is **only** for Level 1 display titles. Section titles are never italic Barlow.

Do **not** split Level 1 display titles into two colors (no orange accent word).

## Critical don'ts

- Do **not** use Barlow in navigation, section titles, table headers, or calendar day headers
- Do **not** turn Training into giant italic `TRAINING`
- Do **not** uppercase workout names (`EASY RIDE`)
- Do **not** put poster type inside table cells — use `TablePosterHeading` **above** tables
- Do **not** use a separate Barlow “section” style — `title-section` is Manrope
- Do **not** accent individual words in `title-display`

## Components

- `PageHeader` → functional `title-page`
- `SectionTitle` → Level 2 `title-section` (Manrope)
- `TablePosterHeading` → Level 2 `title-section`
- Season Plan header → `title-display` (single color)
- Home greeting → `tt-dashboard-title` (display variant, single color)
- Home: Today's workout, Upcoming, This week → `title-section`; right-column KPI labels → eyebrows
